Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:10.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind to march \Ninto the Shaderan house,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:14.23,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,in order to face my parents \Nand to ascertain the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:24.56,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I have an urgent message for Baron Shaderan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.10,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Please open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:28.14,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,If you don't, something terrible will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.48,Default,Tania,0,0,0,,What's impossible is impossible! \NNow go on and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:33.84,Default,Tania,0,0,0,,Actually, haven't I seen \Nyou somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.77,Default Top,Tomas,0,0,0,,You're imagining things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.83,Default Top,Tomas,0,0,0,,What's more important right now \Nis that you open this gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, you're really certain about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.09,Default Top,Tania,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:40.47,Default Top,Tomas; background,0,0,0,,Open the gate! Open it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.38,Default Top,Tania; background,0,0,0,,No! I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:42.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.10,Default Top,Tomas; background,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:48.06,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,If they won't open up, then we'll just \Nhave to force our way through, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:53.33,Default,Tania,0,0,0,,How many times do I have \Nto tell you? Enough is—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:59.48,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Punch through, Ringomaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:05.29,Default,Tania,0,0,0,,You have a terrible taste in names!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:07.74,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I-I did try to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:43.99,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fs14.50\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(506,410)\pos(517,317)}Episode 12 "It's Time to Settle This"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:50.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.94,Default Top,Gregor,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:58.91,Default Top,Gregor,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:02.23,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I-Is she really a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:09.33,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He wouldn't stop making a fuss, so I \Ntook the liberty of restraining him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.29,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,What is all this? What do \Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:15.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to see you, Baron Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Or rather... Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:20.50,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I've brought the baroness and their son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:33.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Father. Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.34,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Big Sis Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:42.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Cedric!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:46.64,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It seems that no one in your family \Nhas realized who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:50.90,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Well, when you came to the workshop, \Nyou believed I was a boy, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.55,0:03:53.58,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.66,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But why disguise yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:04:00.04,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I have to see it with my own eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.84,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,to make certain that the same \Nmistakes never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.56,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:09.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You didn't reply about the betrothal \Nceremony no matter how long we waited,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:11.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,so we came to see you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:14.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,We hoped that you would give \Nour love your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:18.65,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you do not believe \Nthat we love each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:20.36,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,then I'd like you to look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:24.51,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's a record in which I've written \Nexactly how much I love Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:26.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.23,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Is that man really all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.23,0:04:31.33,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No, he's too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:35.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-In any case, I'd like \Nto have a proper talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Let's go to the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:46.13,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,My father and mother... \NWhat will happen to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.68,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,It's all right. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.55,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Trust your big sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:52.77,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Big sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:56.73,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Oh! Um... Just don't worry, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.14,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:06.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It isn't likely that they'll see \Nthrough my sister's disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:11.98,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:13.25,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.95,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,This is all so sudden, it's \Nmade me feel a little ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:20.32,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is this servant here? \NWhat sinister red hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:23.11,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,The same cursed hair as Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Baroness, that is an old superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.70,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,It's no superstition!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:32.38,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Because of Marie, both Lady \NSasha and Anastasia died!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.51,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,So why is Marie the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.40,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,They looked like princesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.52,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Both Lady Sasha and Anastasia \Nwere far more worthy, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:40.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mother, your hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.15,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Don't trouble yourself over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:46.65,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Please just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:59.38,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,How dare you treat me with such disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:01.55,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,You really are born of \Nbarbarians, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.57,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I have nothing to discuss with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.04,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Hurry up and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:10.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please don't run away, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:14.29,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,R-Run away? Just who do you \Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:17.52,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I am the lord of this land and your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Lord of the land? A father?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:25.48,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,What did you say? You—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:29.49,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Baron Shaderan, this is a written notice of \Nthe stripping of your authority as a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:35.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You can't speak Flarian, which is essential \Nfor managing your lands, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:36.71,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:39.13,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I just hate foreign languages, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:41.51,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,In that case, please say \Nsomething in Flarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:43.58,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,A simple conversation will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.25,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:49.69,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,After Sasha Shaderan passed away,\Nyou failed to officially inform the crown
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:54.26,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,that you had your daughter Marie act in \Nyour stead. We've already investigated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:59.94,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Gregor Shaderan, we cannot entrust the \Nlives of our precious citizens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,For abandoning your \Nofficial duties as a lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,and the crime of covering it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.16,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,you will pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:20.17,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,A-Am I... going to lose everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:25.16,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There is one way to preserve the barony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:30.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Although the Granado family \Nwill essentially take over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:33.10,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,you would retain your title and residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Talented personnel will be dispatched here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:38.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,However, there is one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.18,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,A condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:52.33,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,For violating her dignity, brainwashing \Nher, and tying her down to this house...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:59.68,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you apologize for these inhumane acts and \Nask for help, then I promise you assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:02.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All of us here discussed it, \Nand that is what we decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Father, please give me your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:10.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Why didn't you follow the proper procedures? \NWhy force everything on me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.24,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,S-Stop whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.83,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,It's only natural for a good-for-nothing \Ndaughter to obey her parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:21.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Not only do you show no gratitude towards \NMarie, even now, you take that attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.60,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,As a fellow noble, let me say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:29.84,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,To apologize. \NTo seek help. To feel gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Each of those things are essential in a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:38.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If there's something you can't do, then \Nask for help and rely on someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:43.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you show your gratitude properly, \Nthen there is no embarrassment or crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:48.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The true crime is to protect one's \Nown pride by turning truth into lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:50.70,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,and to hold others in contempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That egocentrism is the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:09:00.31,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The previous baroness, Sasha, hoped for \Nyour growth as a lord here, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.78,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.79,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.23,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Mother... My mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:12.22,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,never expected anything from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:19.48,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You wanted Lady Sasha to \Nhave high hopes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:32.29,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I-I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:37.02,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,That's enough! Are you happy \Ndestroying your own house?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:40.15,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Just how much misfortune must you \Nbring us before you're satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.94,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,That red hair will bring \Nunhappiness to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:47.91,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Lady Sasha and my darling \NAnastasia... you killed them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:49.02,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Now, look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:53.10,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to tell you, but I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.03,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:10:00.39,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Could you please not blame Marie for \Nall these bizarre offenses you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:04.28,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,And really, I guess my blonde \Nhair was all you ever saw in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:08.71,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,You've come back to me, my Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:14.23,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Oh, this blonde hair!\NIt's so beautiful! My princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.32,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.76,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:22.35,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Mama, I have never once been your Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:27.89,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mother. As I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:33.41,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Hair... My hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:35.40,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Sh-She has red hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.79,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It seems that the baron knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:45.17,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,To look down on Marie like that when \Nher own hair is the same color...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:48.23,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Marie cannot possibly find happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:50.30,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,She has the same red hair as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:53.09,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,She isn't like Lady Sasha and Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mother, you wanted to believe, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie... What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:07.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mother, for you, to be like \NGrandmother and Anastasia,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:11.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,ladies with small builds and beautiful \Nblonde hair, was essential for being a "princess."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You must admire and envy them so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And that's why you wanted to believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:22.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,believe that women like us, with our \Nred hair and our height, meet with misfortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That it's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:25.94,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.35,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Stop talking! Stop talking! Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.92,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,What can you possibly know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:32.17,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Someone with red hair can never be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:34.42,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,They can never become a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:36.79,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Even Lady Sasha never loved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:40.66,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,That is how it has always been for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:44.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I always rejected myself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.25,0:11:47.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I thought that no one could ever love me,\N and so I closed off my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:54.31,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,after meeting Lord Kyros and everyone at the \Ncastle, I've finally realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:12:00.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That I lacked courage... \Nthe courage to face myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, and you, too, Mio...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,and everyone from the \Ncastle who isn't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:15.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry for leading you around and \Nhurting you with my baseless assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:17.33,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:26.53,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I want to walk into the future with Lord \NKyros and everyone at Granado Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:32.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,So let's put an end to this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:39.89,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,A-Anastasia! You, you are \Nthe one person who always...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:47.53,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Mama... no. Elvira Shaderan, \NMarie and I are not your dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:53.29,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Please don't keep us tied down any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:20.97,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,In the end, the House of Granado \Ntook control of the Shaderan lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:27.57,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,In order to return and become the next lord, \NCedric is studying hard at a school in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:35.11,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,And Father is attending the same school as \NCedric, taking a gruelingly strict course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:39.20,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,If he manages to graduate, he'll \Nbe allowed to become Cedric's valet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:41.50,Letter Font,text; left,0,0,0,,{\b1\pos(112.25,62)\c&H3C6C66&}Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.87,0:13:41.50,Letter Font,text; right,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&H3C6C66&\pos(498,0)}Son's\NValet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.51,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,and return to the Shaderan lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:44.62,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,His future seems likely to \Nbe filled with difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:51.86,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Still, that baron certainly \Nseems to be working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:55.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Well, he found Lady Sasha's \Njournal in a storehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.88,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:02.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Apparently, she'd written down her \Nfeelings about the baron and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.85,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sure it must have given \Nhim something to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:10.36,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,Mother was exempt from \Nany legal consequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:14.95,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,but now she lives in that \Nempty house all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:23.23,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,If you can't open the door, then \Nhow about going in through a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.23,0:14:27.70,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Stop being silly. I'm grateful that you \Ngave me a ride on your horse, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:31.53,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You're no fun. I know you'd feel \Nforlorn if you were all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:33.38,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Th-That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:38.00,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,No, the truth is, I'm so anxious \NI don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:42.53,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I've been lying to Old Man Norman \Never since I first met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:45.77,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm Arthur! You got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:51.01,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Asking him to allow me to continue working \Nwith him would be entirely too selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:55.74,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You cast aside a life of \Nbeing treated like a doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:59.28,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,and grabbed the chance of a life \Ndoing what you like, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.61,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,In that case, you have to have courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.89,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I'm always on the side \Nof people who work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.89,0:15:05.71,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now, go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.52,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.95,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Old Man Norman...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:17.64,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.99,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,The count told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.14,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,I hear your name isn't \NArthur, it's Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.37,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.15,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What? These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:32.81,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:35.28,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,I've ordered hammers and gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:36.92,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:40.58,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,I'll have to change all the \Ntools to suit your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:45.17,Default,Norman,0,0,0,,You should've told me the truth \Nsooner, my idiot apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:49.27,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:51.62,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:57.55,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:01.93,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Good. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:05.16,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now, shall we go, Ringomaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.32,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,And so the height of summer arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:35.84,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:39.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I become the future bride \Nof the person I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.28,Default,nobleman,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.02,Default,noblewoman,0,0,0,,And the plating is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:59.73,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Toppo's cooking is the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:05.04,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,I recommend the special apple pie as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.74,Default,noblewoman A,0,0,0,,Oh, how lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.73,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,It's because I had such \Ngood material to work with!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:16.10,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,You see? If we do this here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:20.10,Default,noblewoman B,0,0,0,,Oh, how modern!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:20.88,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:25.27,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,this hair oil can be ordered through\Nthe Granado Trading Company in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:31.17,Default,nobleman A,0,0,0,,My, this looks magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.41,0:17:36.73,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,It isn't just looks!\NIt's also extremely practical!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:56.78,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Marie is so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:18:00.53,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,I wish someone would be my \Nescort like that sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:01.86,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.95,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Please, take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:07.01,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Will you come and dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:09.61,Default,Caecilie,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:19.50,Default,Wolfgang,0,0,0,,I have waited so impatiently for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:23.28,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My lady! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.35,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,You look beautiful, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:28.80,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Come now. You are just as beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:31.08,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Ugh, you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:32.69,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:35.52,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,That honesty of yours that doesn't \Nhesitate even in the face of royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.95,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You're a type I've never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:44.38,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Say, would you like to \Ngive being my wife a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.13,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:45.80,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:49.51,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What's wrong? The betrothal's \Nset now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:54.56,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,A-Actually, the thing is, I already have \Nfive fiancées that I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:56.02,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:59.69,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hey! I do happen to be a prince, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:02.21,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:05.70,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I have no time to look \Nafter a grumbling prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.64,0:19:16.31,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I was worried about what might happen, \Nbut we've made it to this day safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:20.08,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I never imagined I'd be able to \Nsee my son shining like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:23.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It must be because you raised \Nhim with love, Lady Liu Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:27.08,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,No, it's thanks to you, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:28.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:32.46,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You stayed beside the two of them \Nand supported them. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:38.78,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,So, as the person who had to look \Nafter them, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:41.25,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll make \Na good married couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.25,0:19:42.48,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:48.34,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Both of them are still developing, and the \Nmaster is currently at the height of puberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:51.50,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Stop it! You shouldn't \Ntell the truth like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:56.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,However, I'm certain that \Na happy future awaits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:58.25,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,As to whether it seems believable or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:02.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,the faces of everyone here at the \Ncastle say it all, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:20.31,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.19,0:20:24.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Nothing. I was just remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Remembering everything from \Nthe day I met you until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:33.37,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,When I think about it, we spent most of the \Ntime on different pages from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:37.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That day, when I met you, \Nmy whole world changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:42.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are the first person I ever truly wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:51.42,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, for being born, for \Nbeing at my side... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:55.68,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one who should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:21:02.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That day, light shone into \Nmy closed off little world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:09.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Green eyes more beautiful than any \Nstar brought color into my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:18.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,When I hesitated, you took my \Nhand and moved forward with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:22.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Things I'd forgotten... Things \NI learned for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:27.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Every single one of them created \Nthe "us" that we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:14.11,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,We will find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.43,0:22:18.25,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,As long as we're by each other's sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:32.86,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur2\bord3.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&HB3C4FE&\3c&H39378D&\fs16\fad(231,1)\pos(25,44)\t(2108,2191,1 \shad0)\bord1.5\c&HD8E3FF&\3c&H5872CF&)}Translation: Elanor Sakamoto\N\NSubtitle Timing: Edgar Cruz\N\NEditing and Typesetting: Ashley Barboza\N\NQuality Control: S. Bilyeu\N\NTranslation Check: Michelle Tymon
